{
    "name": "Guitar Overdrive Pedal (Soft-Clip)",
    "description": "A Tube-Screamer-style overdrive pedal: a single-supply op-amp non-inverting gain stage (×11.85) with anti-parallel diodes in the feedback for soft clipping, mid-rail bias, input/output coupling, and a tone-shaping RC. Run a transient with a guitar-level sine — the peaks compress to one diode-drop (incremental gain falls to ×1.2 at the crests), the classic warm overdrive. (Validated on ngspice.)",
    "tags": ["audio", "guitar", "overdrive", "distortion", "opamp", "clipping"],
